<title>UK: World Bank sets 150 mln rand 5-year step-down bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 150 mln rand 5-year step-down bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON    *15.75 PCT MATURITY    04.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP DOWN     ISS PRICE  101.59    PAY DATE    04.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.79     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    *FOR YEAR ONE, 13.75 PCT YEAR TWO, 13.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50	  SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
